---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '../assets/photos/headshot-about.jpg';
---

<section class="band fade" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <figure aria-label="Portrait of Alissa Whittle">
        <Image
          src={portrait}
          alt="Alissa Whittle"
          widths={[400, 600, 900]}
          sizes="(min-width: 880px) 35vw, 90vw"
          quality={82}
          class="portrait-photo"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </figure>
      <div class="about-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">III &nbsp;·&nbsp; About</span>
        <h2 id="about-h">Community first. <i>Investments</i> second.</h2>
        <p class="bio">In financial planning since 2003, now operating independently under LPL Financial. Also, and at least as importantly: a Girl Scouts leader since 2011, a foster parent since 2012, host family for Up with People and Greenheart exchange students, mission work in Bolivia, reef restoration with the Coral Restoration Foundation. Rotary, Toastmasters, Chamber, BPW. She does both jobs the same way: by showing up, knowing your name, staying for the long version.</p>
        <a href="/about" class="tlink">Read full bio <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <div class="about-meta">
          <span><b>BFA™ · CPFA</b>designations held</span>
          <span><b>Since 2003</b>in the industry</span>
          <span><b>Fiduciary</b>not commission-based</span>
          <span><b>CRD&nbsp;6445648</b>FINRA registered</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
